# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nowhere Central — what does not ship
#
# The rule this file follows is the one CLAUDE.md already sets for the
# asset tree: the repository holds what the site serves, and nothing
# else. Everything below is generated, local to one machine, or a
# master that an encode in assets/ was derived from.
#
# Note what is deliberately NOT ignored: dev/ is tracked on purpose.
# Those pages are how the audio rig gets tuned, and they are worth
# versioning even though no visitor ever loads them.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---- dependencies and build output -------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# ---- tooling output, not the site --------------------------------
graphify-out/

# ---- logs and scratch --------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*~

# ---- media masters -----------------------------------------------
# The site loads the encodes in assets/. The sources they came from
# are hundreds of megabytes and belong in your own folders, not in a
# repo that has to stay clonable and deployable as a unit.
*.psd
*.ai
*.aep
*.prproj
*.wav
*.aiff
*.flac
*-master.*

# ---- local environment -------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
docker-compose.override.yml

# ---- editors and operating systems --------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# local self-signed dev certs — machine-specific, never shipped
certs/

# Claude Code local tool config (machine-specific path)
.claude/
